      "message": "ci: PR test job runs on any camcraft-pr-test runner (Linux or macOS)\n\npr-test.yml's runs-on was [self-hosted, linux, camcraft-pr-test], so the\nmacOS runner never took a job. Drop the linux label; update the header,\nAGENTS.md \"The PR test runner\", and the runner-online check and wording in\nPR-reviewer.md and review-prs/SKILL.md. The steps are already bash 3.2 and\nBSD-tool safe, so no other change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
